### 1. List tiers (seeded: SILVER / GOLD / PLATINUM)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tiers

### 2. Register a customer (starts at the lowest tier)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha",
  "email": "asha@mail.com",
  "phone": "9999999999"
}

### 3. Purchase Rs.1000 -> Silver 2% discount, earns points
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "amount": 1000
}

### 4. Purchase Rs.200 -> lifetime points cross 1000 -> auto-upgrade to GOLD
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "amount": 200
}

### 5. Purchase with redemption of 100 points (Gold discount applies)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "amount": 500,
  "pointsToRedeem": 100
}

### 6. Redeem more than balance -> 422 Unprocessable Entity (nothing saved)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "amount": 500,
  "pointsToRedeem": 999999
}

### 7. Invalid amount -> 400 Bad Request with field errors
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "amount": -5
}

### 8. Unknown customer -> 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999,
  "amount": 100
}

### 9. Duplicate email -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Again",
  "email": "asha@mail.com"
}

### 10. Points history (newest first)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1/points-history?page=0&size=10

### 11. Current tier, balances and progress to next tier
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1

### 12. Purchase history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/purchases/customer/1

### 13. Add a tier (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tiers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DIAMOND",
  "minPoints": 20000,
  "discountPercent": 15
}
